{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-06",
  "title": "战场，蔓延不止",
  "storyCode": "R8-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1aef41ea6dee9ef8867d07e680619d0ad16560dacd098e660f2b9350b2785f12",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "晖洁：\n最开始成为感染者的时候，我过得浑浑噩噩的。\n我知道科西切想利用我做很多事，但总是在害怕，他究竟要我做什么？\n他是不是打算用些什么手段，让我花这么多时间建立起的感染者通信网毁于一旦？\n还是说，他打算让我分裂感染者，让他们分散成城市派和聚落派？\n更可怕的一种情况是，他会不会打算让感染者成为新的军队，重新让乌萨斯走入战争？\n我只能猜测。灰暗萦绕在我的头上，挥之不去。\n但我只能向前走。\n有个雪怪，似乎是叫佩特洛娃的，她昨天拿瘤奶炒了油籽，这做法真奇特。味道还挺有趣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那件事......我想起来了。真快，这都过去两年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "战士们传来传去的是真的吗，所以你真和她打了一架？听说你们把那个废弃城市都炸没了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没那么夸张。传言总是会变得越来越匪夷所思......我只是把她的源石冰晶烧化了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨申卡，不准乱跑，会滑倒的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看他们这能够自在生活的样子。挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是我的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没想到你会自告奋勇去教孩子们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我跟孩子的感情可比跟乌萨斯之间的感情好。你刚才说你把什么东西烧化了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜星的源石冰晶。她小队使用的一种法术装置，我猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可是......霜星，她肯定不服气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，没错。吐一口气的功夫，我就被她冻上了半边身子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我反应过来，她已经冲着我的脖子一冰刀砍过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我拦住了她的刀，嘶的一声，这把剑这么几年来头一次结了霜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她大概也是第一次看到有人能把她的刀切出豁口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，看得出你很乐意说这段事。你是不是还挺自豪的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也没......好吧确实......呃，这个孩子，躲在牧栏后面的那个，她叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "柳包芙。别在这偷听，柳巴！下节课我就读故事给你们听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，就讲个灰色森林里的鬼魂故事吧......很可怕的故事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去帮老师拿些木屑来，好吗？用篮子装。谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜星......阿丽娜，你也知道，这可是霜星。她的名字比我更早在西北冻原感染者术师间传开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以为你不喜欢别人把你的名字说来说去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有人拿这个名字去威胁别人，我当然不乐意。但要是战士们听到这个名字就想挑战我本人，那挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和你不一样，霜星可不会接受什么挑战。这样想，你真的把她惹火了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是感染者里顶尖的术师，顶尖的那种小队指挥，也是感染者里最强的战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不要误会，我没冲着这个目标去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可在很多人眼里，你们是有相像之处的。孩子们有的说想以后变得像霜星一样，也有的说想当你这样的英雄呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "停，停。我真的不喜欢这个词。你呢，阿丽娜，你又是怎么想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我眼里每个人都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我总觉得你就是会这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实，我也不太知道霜星小时候过的是怎样的生活，她的教养很好，可能她过得还不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可别让任何一个孩子经历我经历的这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也很有教养。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不愿意提这事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......塔露拉，我们谁也不知道这片大地留给他们的遭遇，会不会比我们遇见过的更荒唐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "丧气话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也是我想做老师的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的“老师”可不是你这样子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我明白你的意思了。你是说霜星也许也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁知道呢。没有一个感染者的人生是相同的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总之，和霜星争执过后，我就再也没敢在技巧训练上懈怠过。别说法术，剑术也是。这些我可都不能输给她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你和她打了一架我知道了，然后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撑到她气消了，她才告诉我这事她不做主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就只有一个人能做主了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像你说的这样，是的。在我们这场斗殴结束后没过多久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......从城市的另一端走来了一个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回想一下都那么费力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "应该说是第一眼印象太震撼，使得我只能想方设法挑一些词给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中午的阳光倾洒在他身上，居然照不化他身上淤泥一样的黑色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我正和霜星说着我的计划，我说到我会联系上其他城市的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想要调集资金建造或者谋取小型的移动城市，我邀请他们加入计划......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看到他的影子。我说不下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么停下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可不那么有自信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也会没自信？我从来没见你不自信过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可是......爱国者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你没能说服他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到现在都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "后面的事你都清楚，在我和霜星那场“友善的研讨”之后，我们的队伍成功和游击队合流了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "挺好的。再怎么说，在听说能和游击队一起走以后，我们这里许多感染者都很高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这两年来我们过得比以前好，你的选择没有错。这回你是对的，塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可......我想，游击队并不是看重我和其他的感染者战士，只是他们......无法忽视和我们一起同行的其他感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那更没必要丧气了。因为你也是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但两年了。事情没有一点进展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样吧，塔露拉，你是从什么时候开始觉得爱国者不认同你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一年多前......在我们和游击队合流后不久。直到现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "这不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我们甚至不知道冻原上还有多少感染者活在乌萨斯的混蛋统治下，在这时候和游击队说城市的那些感染者，太早了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不是要抛弃冻原的感染者。否则我怎么会带他们一起走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们迟早有一天要回来。我们的目标是让乌萨斯，不，整片大地的感染者团结起来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许我们身处不同的地方，但是我们对自己境遇的不甘没有区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在某座城市中的朋友把这种行为叫做“整合”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他呼吁感染者团结起来，自称“整合运动”，围绕同一个信念，抗议乌萨斯现在这种对感染者的残酷统治。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我们也应该找机会抗议一下冻原上乌萨斯士兵对矿场的压榨，这说不定能让他们痛改前非。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "塔露拉，不说乌萨斯的百姓，我们只说军队，乌萨斯军是不会放过我们任何人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "如果你去南方是为了“抗议”，那我们不如直接去找一个师团送命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌萨斯不是一块铁板。这是我们的机会。整合运动所要做的是传递信念，只是我看到了更多机会。我们还要传递一个信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "什么信号？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“你们并不孤单。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很清楚我们在冻原上只是会消耗自己的力量。我们需要走出冻原。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我不决定这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还不愿意决定这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "如果离去的代价是死亡，我的性命除了能换一两条乌萨斯士兵的命以外也没什么用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "但我们身边的人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "塔露拉，你没有带兄弟姐妹在身边。我不会让他们送死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "不过我觉得那个是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪一个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "告诉感染者他们并不孤单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "在雪原上我们花了太多时间在一件事上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "找寻朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "但是，去联合城市的感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "看来从大城市来的青年确实更喜欢幻想一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还不想被你嘲笑，霜星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我不嘲笑你。你很强，你带着他们走了很长的路，和我们一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "但向南方去就是种幻想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "游击队在壮大，但我们是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我们没剩下几年时间......而你的联合又需要多少年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正因如此——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "爸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爱国者先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爱国者在篝火旁坐下。和塔露拉不断在脑海中模拟的场景一样，爱国者只是坐下，一言不发，注视着篝火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "没事的。你继续说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "正因为我们不剩下多少时间了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "南方有丰产的田地，有适宜的温度，有四季变化，有新鲜的食物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "资源，教育，前景......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "以及未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——未来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "霜星，我很可能知道你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我的想法已经写在脸上了。我不知道什么叫做“未来”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "留给我们的时间确实不多，我们能够踏足的地方也不会有多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "但感染者应该有未来。属于未来的感染者的，属于我们之后的人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "霜星......我们给那些感染者找一个家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "可以不被乌萨斯的感染者纠察队骚扰的地方，不被乌萨斯军队所包围的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "你也很清楚，带着感染者一起会让游击队的行动受阻。但我们不会放弃他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "这将是条艰难的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少，我们在死前创造的那些希望，是可以留给其他人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以及，如果我们推翻乌萨斯现在这个感染者制度......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一切都会改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我们势单力薄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "如果你不是感染者，你会和我握手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们就从握手开始做起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......你说的这些，可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "爸？你去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱国者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "别太在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他可能只是在考虑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他也确实考虑很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "两年来，我和他的所有谈话也都只是关于队伍建设和接下来的安排。他从来没有一次问起我有关的计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉，不管他是在嘲笑你还是在反对你——啊，我觉得他不太像是个会嘲笑别人的人——你都会等下去的。我有没有说错？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想走出冻原，我们不能没有游击队的力量。我会坚持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为他是冻原感染者的希望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以为你不会这么说。如果是你应该......不会这么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是想知道你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我想，是因为他才是那个冻原感染者团结的象征。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个象征是没办法被传递到下一代手里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "起来！你还要在那呆到什么时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你冻着我了，你这白兔子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "就算你那只是点小火苗，可不能连这点冷气都撑不住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在你冰封这些乌萨斯人的武器时，你可不是这么说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "兄弟姐妹，撤退！让他们追！把矿场的守军引出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撑到盾卫支援我们就好！别放弃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "——快。快走。快点。游击队已经包夹过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是怎么判断——等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那几个奇怪的源石装饰品，是游击队布置的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "那是为我父亲设置的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌萨斯军没有再追赶我们了。他们似乎很忌惮那东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，这是不是......是不是什么萨卡兹的东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "他的萨卡兹仪式。现在这两个，已经算是手头材料能做出来最好的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爱国者......爱国者在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "你也说了，我们这支队伍被袭击是意料中的事。既然你说要在这里消灭这个连队，那光靠我们的小队当然是不够的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......敌人已经开始骚动不安了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "你见过我父亲战斗的样子吗，塔露拉......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯当地驻军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......他......是他......你们怎么没说......没说他在这！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯当地驻军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撤退！撤退！！别管了，别管了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯当地驻军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等！他是从队伍尾部来的？那我们面前这些是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯当地驻军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂？喂？！说话！说话！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱国者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_025_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直至本地驻军向他发动猛攻前，众人面前矗立着的高大萨卡兹没有做出任何动作，没有发出任何声音。\n但塔露拉仿佛听见冻原的北风中夹杂着哭叫，那是这片大地本身的颤抖，它的邪恶在温迪戈面前节节退缩。\n爱国者站定，向冻原投出了手中长戟。\n只懂如何吞食活物生命的阴郁天空忽地被刺出一个空洞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
